516705516705517}, {"text": "Question 10 (12 marks) Start a new booklet", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.5483516483516484, "y1": 0.10101010101010101}, {"text": "Jane has a bottle containing 200 millilitres of water. She pours more water", "x0": 0.21208791208791208, "y0": 0.17016317016317017, "x1": 0.810989010989011, "y1": 0.18337218337218336}, {"text": "(a)", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.17094017094017094, "x1": 0.17252747252747253, "y1": 0.1825951825951826}, {"text": "in", "x0": 0.8164835164835165, "y0": 0.17404817404817405, "x1": 0.8307692307692308, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "for 20 seconds until it is full. During this time, the flow rate (R) of the", "x0": 0.21318681318681318, "y0": 0.1864801864801865, "x1": 0.7813186813186813, "y1": 0.19968919968919968}, {"text": "water", "x0": 0.7879120879120879, "y0": 0.1888111888111888, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "is given by R =4(20\u20141) millilitres/sec.", "x0": 0.21208791208791208, "y0": 0.20357420357420358, "x1": 0.5307692307692308, "y1": 0.21678321678321677}, {"text": "(i) Find an expression for the volume after seconds, where t < 20.", "x0": 0.21208791208791208, "y0": 0.27195027195027194, "x1": 0.8, "y1": 0.2851592851592852}, {"text": "(ii) How many millilitres are in the bottle when it is full.", "x0": 0.21208791208791208, "y0": 0.3372183372183372, "x1": 0.6956043956043956, "y1": 0.3504273504273504}, {"text": "(iii) How long was it before the bottle was half full? Give your answer", "x0": 0.21208791208791208, "y0": 0.40326340326340326, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.41647241647241645}, {"text": "in exact form.", "x0": 0.2725274725274725, "y0": 0.4195804195804196, "x1": 0.38351648351648354, "y1": 0.4296814296814297}, {"text": "Question 10 continues on page 12", "x0": 0.38351648351648354, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.6681318681318681, "y1": 0.6293706293706294}, {"text": "Page 11 of 12", "x0": 0.44505494505494503, "y0": 0.9440559